<v Daniel>a cabin for a decade.</v>

148
00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:12.991
<v Maya>No, not at all.</v>

149
00:19:13.451 --> 00:19:22.977
<v Daniel>It was dumped onto GitHub as unpolished, raw research data by an unnamed internal AI model, generated faster than any human expert could even read it.</v>

150
00:19:23.097 --> 00:19:24.338
<v Maya>It's wild to think about.</v>

151
00:19:24.938 --> 00:19:39.931
<v Daniel>Are we moving into a future where AI casually generates profound foundational mathematical truths and human mathematicians are reduced to archaeologists just sifting through AI data dumps, trying to reverse engineer and understand the brilliance of the proofs it leaves</v>

152
00:19:39.991 --> 00:19:43.078
<v Daniel>behind? Something to think about the next time you look at a shipping route.</v>
